 layouts, adaptive interfaces, and reusable Flutter components that scale across different screen sizes and interaction models.","conclusion":"Built a flexible Flutter application capable of adapting its interface across Android phones and TV platforms while maintaining a consistent and responsive user experience.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/atlas/atlas book thumbanil.jpeg","alt":"Atlas Flutter cross-platform mobile preview"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/atlas/atlass.jpeg","alt":"Atlas mobile and Android TV Flutter application"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/atlas/atlass.jpeg","alt":"Atlas unified interface design"},"images":[{"src":"/images/atlas/atlass.jpeg","alt":"Atlas phone interface and touch navigation"},{"src":"/images/atlas/atlas 2.jpeg","alt":"Atlas adaptive screen layout"},{"src":"/images/atlas/atlas 1.jpeg","alt":"Atlas Android TV directional controls view"}],"services":["Flutter Development","Android Development","TV App Development","Responsive UI"],"client":"Atlas","website":"","tags":["Flutter","Dart","Android","Android TV","Responsive UI"],"serviceSlugs":["flutter-app-development"],"link":"","quote":"Designed to seamlessly bridge mobile touch interaction and Android TV directional navigation using a single unified Flutter codebase.","quoteAuthor":"Product Concept","quoteRole":"Cross-Platform Strategy & UX Architecture","credits":[{"role":"Flutter Development","name":"Outman El Bouhali"},{"role":"Cross-Platform Architecture","name":"Outman El Bouhali"},{"role":"Responsive UI Development","name":"Outman El Bouhali"}]},"nextProject":{"slug":"pong-arena","title":"Pong Arena","category":"Full Stack Web App","year":"2024","tagline":"Real-time multiplayer gaming built for the web.","description":"A full-stack multiplayer gaming platform built with Django and JavaScript, featuring real-time gameplay, WebSockets, and tournament management.","overview":"Pong Arena is a full-stack multiplayer web application built with Django and JavaScript. The platform combines a Django backend with a dynamic JavaScript frontend, using WebSockets to enable real-time multiplayer communication and gameplay. It also includes player management, matchmaking, and tournament functionality.","conclusion":"Built and delivered a complete real-time multiplayer platform, combining backend architecture, WebSocket communication, interactive game logic, and responsive frontend experiences.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/pong/pong thumbnail.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena multiplayer game preview"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/pong/pong thumbnail.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena real-time WebSocket match showcase"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/pong/Create_a_mockup_2k_202602141753.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena device mockups"},"images":[{"src":"/images/pong/pongarena1.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena tournament lobby screen"},{"src":"/images/pong/Create_a_mockup_2k_202602141751.jpeg","alt":"Pong Arena live gameplay screen"}],"services":["Full Stack Development","Django Backend","JavaScript Frontend","WebSocket Architecture"],"client":"42 Network / Open Source","website":"https://github.com/oelbouha/ft_transcendence","tags":["Django","JavaScript","WebSockets","Full Stack"],"serviceSlugs":["django-python-development","web-application-development"],"link":"https://github.com/oelbouha/ft_transcendence","quote":"A complete real-time multiplayer experience combining solid backend architecture with responsive gameplay.","quoteAuthor":"42 Network","quoteRole":"Open Source Community","credits":[{"role":"Full Stack Development","name":"Outman El Bouha"},{"role":"Real-Time Architecture","name":"Outman El Bouha"},{"role":"Game Development","name":"Outman El Bouha"}]}}]],["$L19","$L1a","$L1b"],"$L1c"]}],"p":"$@1d","v":null,"s":"$d"}}]]
